# Bulk artifacts live in the sibling ../hardware-doc-archive - its own git repository,
# but normally unpublished/private because of its size. Each artifact moved there leaves
# a *.ARCHIVED.md placeholder here carrying size, SHA-256 and recovery URLs.
#
# `archive` is a tracked symlink to it (relative: ../hardware-doc-archive), so the
# archive is reachable as ./archive/... when present. This entry stops the archive's
# CONTENTS being committed here if the link is ever replaced by a real directory; it
# does not (and cannot) affect the tracked symlink itself - .gitignore never applies to
# tracked paths. See AGENTS.md "Symlinks and --skip-worktree".
archive/*

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
